  "article_notes": "Onderstepoort (OVAH) prospective study, Dec 2015-Jan 2017; 35 B. rossi dogs (PCR/RLB, B. vogeli and E. canis excluded), 10 healthy controls. Samples at presentation before any therapy. 25 complicated vs 10 uncomplicated (complications at presentation or during hospitalisation). Only 4 dogs died (2 spontaneously, 2 euthanised); no comparison by outcome. Follow-up (T24h, T1m) comparisons are changes over time, not by severity, and were not extracted. Some dogs probably overlap with other Onderstepoort cohorts from protocol V034-14 (shared with the CB040 pooled cohort); not stated explicitly. Small groups; authors note possible type II error.",
  "skipped_infected_vs_healthy": 26,
  "setting": "referral hospital",
  "sample_timing": "before treatment",
